[0.0, "o", "# Mariano's collector 1.10.0rc6 (commit d77f306), recorded on Hamza's own Azure test VM (Ubuntu 24.04),\r\n"]
[0.35, "o", "# not on the client's VM. Store: Mariano's Vernon Hills 53100502, PICKUP. Provider: Oxylabs Web API,\r\n"]
[0.7, "o", "# the credit Hamza supplied, every submission reserved in its own spending ledger before it is sent.\r\n"]
[1.051, "o", "# Every command below runs for real while it is recorded; nothing is edited afterwards. The published\r\n"]
[1.401, "o", "# copy masks private identifiers (host name, paths) and nothing else.\r\n"]
[1.751, "o", "# The run shown is the logical full-scope run 01M7KQ5GZVF5VK1S9FGTG6YFC9, read in slices; this is the slice M-R7w-walkthrough-110rc6\r\n"]
